OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the south
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain. Staying
OL,7,Flargely cloudy in southern England and
OL,8,FWales with rain at times. Sunny spells
OL,9,Felsewhere and showers across Scotland.
OL,10,FAnother windy day but feeling warm in
OL,11,Fany sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying cloudy and mild in
OL,14,Fthe south tonight with a few outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain possible. A fresher feel in
OL,16,Fthe north with clear spells. Winds
OL,17,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
